Your moat isn't scraping prices.

It's the accumulating **observation ledger**:

```text
2026-08-18T01:02 provider X latency = 311ms
2026-08-18T01:02 provider X tool calling passed 47/50
2026-08-18T01:06 MCP Y schema hash changed
2026-08-18T01:10 provider Z quota page changed
